cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the archived release and the associated
  research article.
type: software
title: "MV-GSNMF: Code and Reproducibility"
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility release for the MV-GSNMF study of shared latent factorization
  in Traditional Chinese Medicine prescription mining. The release contains
  model code, experiment configurations, derived analysis matrices, aggregate
  results, and scripts for the reported ablation and baseline evaluations.
